      "parent_verdict": "pass",
      "parent_visual": {
        "decision": "Bounded pass for the consistent stylized decorative composition only. Do not elevate matching palette/pattern placement into barkcloth or volcanic-material realism.",
        "hardware": "Family clasp, round front fitting, side ring and corner caps are visible; rear hinges appear positioned at the open rim. Expected upright released latch is not classified as detached.",
        "limitations": "Frozen still-image review only; supplied technical passes were not rerun. No final user approval, photoreal equivalence, physical-phone performance, cultural authentication or continuous mechanical certification. Open disengaged latch is expected; hidden exterior lid ornament in open views is not missing. Invented siapo-inspired motifs are not authenticated traditional designs. Preserve cool cast, smoother-than-lava surfaces, subtle ripples and low mobile lid detail; warm brown cavity is visible in open captures.",
        "quality": "Cream/rust patterned panels, cool charcoal frame and brass are coherent and legible; closed/open states fit desktop/mobile. Marketing shares the gridded angular rosettes and rear-left rock accents.",
        "terrain": "Small generic angular lava-rock accents, not Saleaula terrain; subdued on mobile. The waved lid panel reads as a shallow rigid decorative insert rather than draped cloth.",
        "texture": "Strongly repeated cream/rust grid is clearer on front than washed-out lid. Neither actual nor marketing establishes fibrous barkcloth; charcoal frame is mottled cool blue-gray stone, not unmistakably porous lava. Border crops are not fully continuous."
      },
